===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Scizor|128}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*'''Gale Thrust''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Scizor-EX|76}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

